Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:07.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:08.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,I just it was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:09.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,exciting like we were
