Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.50,0:00:10.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:11.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,What were they thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:11.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,No, it was really
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:12.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,fun. And they were
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,thinking they were thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:14.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,right because we did
